[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315190974","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110693#issuecomment-3315190974","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110693","id":3315190974,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Fmcy-","user":{"login":"wheatear-dev","id":161692702,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaM8Hg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161692702?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev","html_url":"https://github.com/wheatear-dev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-20T19:29:47Z","updated_at":"2025-09-20T19:32:27Z","body":"Follow up question - and I appreciate this significantly expands scope!\n\nThere are a fair few places where classes - directly or otherwise - inherit from `Object`, yet do not define `GDCLASS` or `GDSOFTCLASS`. Is that expected? Could these all exhibit a similar bug?\n\nHere is a conservative regex that finds six such problematic (?) classes, that directly inherit from `Object`.\n\nPlease note that this requires `ripgrep` to be installed, and was crafted with assistance from ChatGPT, after I had floundered for too long trying - on my own - using GNU grep.\n\nCommand:\n```bash\nrg --pcre2 -n -H -o --multiline --multiline-dotall \\\n  '^(class\\s+(\\w+)\\s*:\\s*public\\s+Object\\s*\\{(?:(?!GDCLASS|GDSOFTCLASS).)*?\\})' \\\n  --glob '*.h' --glob '*.cpp' \\\n  --glob '!*.gen.h' --glob '!test*.h' \\\n  --glob '!thirdparty/**' --glob '!drivers/**' --glob '!modules/**' \\\n  --replace '$2'\n```\n\nOutput:\n```\neditor/editor_node.h\n1016:EditorPluginList\n\nplatform/linuxbsd/tts_linux.h\n47:TTS_Linux\n\nplatform/linuxbsd/freedesktop_portal_desktop.h\n43:FreeDesktopPortalDesktop\n\nservers/rendering/rendering_device_commons.h\n69:RenderingDeviceCommons\n\neditor/scene/2d/tiles/tile_map_layer_editor.h\n51:TileMapLayerSubEditorPlugin\n\nscene/theme/theme_owner.h\n41:ThemeOwner\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315190974/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315951384","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110693#issuecomment-3315951384","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110693","id":3315951384,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FpWcY","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-21T12:04:18Z","updated_at":"2025-09-21T12:05:01Z","body":"> There are a fair few places where classes - directly or otherwise - inherit from Object, yet do not define GDCLASS or GDSOFTCLASS. Is that expected? Could these all exhibit a similar bug?\n\nYes, all inheritors of `Object` should use either `GDCLASS` or `GDSOFTCLASS`, because otherwise they won't be usable with `Object::cast_to`. So making them use either if it's missing is a goal.\n(Ideally, I'd like to statically assert that they do, but unfortunately I haven't found a way to do this with C++)\n\nYour regex is interesting! I think we should add `GDSOFTCLASS` to those classes. Would you be availalable to open a PR for this?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315951384/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3324033385","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110693#issuecomment-3324033385","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110693","id":3324033385,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GILlp","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-23T13:30:09Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T13:30:09Z","body":"This was fixed by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110694, with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110752 as a follow-up.\nThank you again for taking action!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3324033385/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]